menu "Knob test control"

config KNOB_TESTCTL
    bool "Serial test console on USB Serial/JTAG (inject knob/tap, dump screen)"
    default y
    help
        A line-oriented console on the USB Serial/JTAG port for automated verification:
        `knob +3`, `tap`, `hold`, `reset`, `state`, `snap`. Replies start with "> ". `snap` streams the LVGL
        framebuffer as base64 rows prefixed "S:" (host: scripts/testctl.py). Disable for
        production images.

endmenu
